  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A usable mesh is closed where it can be seen: no missing faces. An open face is a hole: through it you see the inside of the object, which is not drawn, so the faces behind it vanish. Imported models often arrive with such holes.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Orbit to the back of this kiosk. What will you see where a face is missing?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Orbit around the kiosk and find the holes.\n2. Select it and use Tools \u203A ProBuilder \u203A Object \u203A Pro Builderize.\n3. In Edge mode, select a hole's border and use Fill Hole.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Editing-Faces 3 \xB7 Missing faces</color></size>"
