      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Six models came in broken: the kind of problems every import can have. A name tag beside each says how it should look. Find what is wrong with each, fix it at the right place (import settings, ProBuilder, or Blender), and keep the fixed versions.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Which of the six can be fixed in the import settings alone, without changing the mesh?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Find: orbit around each model, read its import settings, and select it with Tools \u203A Mavrodiev \u203A Mesh Health open.\n2. Fix: change the import setting where one exists; otherwise Pro Builderize and edit, or fix it in Blender.\n3. Keep: save each fixed model as a prefab in Assets/My-Kit/Fixed.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Stations 1\u20135 of this scene</color></size>"
